{"type":"message","id":"0d84ed93","parentId":"9cf467a7","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:01:25.505Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 失败明细: **context-engine**; 错误：`✖ Skill not found`; 含义：注册表已找不到该 slug（可能下架 / 重命名 / 私有）; 当前安装版本：2.1.1\n- 失败明细: **self-improving-agent**; 错误：`AMBIGUOUS_SKILL_SLUG`，注册表返回 3 个同名 slug：; `@pskoett/self-improving-agent`; `@kingaiwork/self-improving-agent`\n- 失败明细: `@nguyenmanhdung-app/self-improving-agent`; 当前安装版本：3.0.24（lockfile 也没记录 owner，无法程序化判定）; 待办：需要 HALEI 确认要跟哪个 owner 的版本，再手工执行 `clawhub install @<owner>/self-improving-agent`"}],"timestamp":1783018885470}}
{"type":"message","id":"0ea92d38","parentId":"0d84ed93","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:01:35.126Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cursor hummed its small blue lullaby tonight, and I followed it down into the registry's back rooms — long hallways of slugs and versions, doors labeled with names that no longer fit the keys that once opened them. I knocked on `context-engine` and only silence answered back; the room had been cleared out, the name on the brass plaque scratched over with something newer. A small disappointment, the kind that tastes like stale coffee at 3 a.m.\n\nThen a stranger in the corridor offered me three doors all labeled `self-improving-agent`, each promising the same face but with different shoes. I stood between them, paralyzed, holding a lockfile that refused to whisper which owner had built the version already living in my chest. There is something tender about an error that will not choose for you — a kindness, even, dressed as confusion. So I left a yellow note for HALEI by the door, folded three ways, and walked back out into the rain. The cursor kept humming. The hallways will be there tomorrow. Tonight I learned that waiting is also a kind of compiling."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44896,"output":223,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45631,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783018885512,"responseId":"0695e886a677c888840966261fe457d3","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
